{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/855970/extras/199f66c4a6a4ac9c8407abd99f55bf28.avif?t=1772768800\" width=1200 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/855970/extras/49941044e6ba9d2a5363b95c54c49ce2.avif?t=1772768800\" width=1200 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>PREMISE</u></i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were at home, enjoying dinner like any ordinary person. Suddenly, you are abducted by space amazons who unapologetically display their bare chests, disregarding the conventions of decorum that define 21st-century life on Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a deep-space facility, surrounded by impossible soldiers, absurd bureaucracies, and secrets no one is willing to clarify. Amid gunfights, conspiracies, and creatures beyond comprehension, a single question remains: Why were you chosen? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vixens From Outer Space is a pulp-inspired shooter blending humor, Diesel War, sexual tension, and cosmic horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>FEATURING</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURING Fully first-person immersive storytelling \u2014 the entire experience unfolds through the protagonist\u2019s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Story-driven campaign \u2014 scripted moments, grounded pacing, and constant forward momentum. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense gunplay \u2014 brutal, up-close firefights with tight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time for relaxation\u2026 as these space amazons are certainly far from prudish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src